  partName: Intake Manifold Clip
  description: The Intake Manifold Clip is a tiny, elongated component made of Material.001,
    located at the top-center-front of the engine, serving as a securing device for
    the intake manifold. Its small size and strategic position make it a vital component
    in maintaining intake system stability and preventing vibration. Notably, the
    Intake Manifold Clip is designed with a flexible tab to accommodate slight movements
    and variations in engine operation.
